@startuml
actor User
participant "Chrome Extension" as CE
participant "TranslatorResource" as API
participant "BasicAuthFilter" as AUTH
participant "TranslationService" as TS
participant "Gemini API / Fallback" as LLM

User -> CE : Select text + right click
CE -> API : POST /translator/translate
API -> AUTH : Validate Basic Auth
AUTH --> API : Authorized
API -> TS : translate(text, src, target)
TS -> LLM : Request translation
LLM --> TS : translated text
TS --> API : TranslateResponse
API --> CE : JSON response
CE --> User : Display Darija translation
@enduml
